"versionNonce": 1258865433,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "Cómo lo resolvemos:",
"fontSize": 14,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 11,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "Cómo lo resolvemos:",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_c75b718b97ae",
"type": "text",
"x": 6424,
"y": 709.75,
"width": 808,
"height": 18.75,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 651252715,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 214890211,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "1. Girar a la derecha para orientarse a lo largo de las avenidas.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "1. Girar a la derecha para orientarse a lo largo de las avenidas.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_dbff7a6e40e7",
"type": "text",
"x": 6424,
"y": 732.5,
"width": 808,
"height": 18.75,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 1420262282,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 1589042774,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "2. Repetir 100 veces (una vez por calle):",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "2. Repetir 100 veces (una vez por calle):",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_7daf3c0fede2",
"type": "text",
"x": 6424,
"y": 755.25,
"width": 808,
"height": 37.5,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 1600156476,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 1073791917,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "3. Repetir 99 veces: si la esquina actual está libre (sin flor y sin papel) y el robot\ntiene papel en la bolsa, depositarlo; avanzar.",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "3. Repetir 99 veces: si la esquina actual está libre (sin flor y sin papel) y el robot\ntiene papel en la bolsa, depositarlo; avanzar.",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_020a5faaf1ac",
"type": "text",
"x": 6424,
"y": 796.75,
"width": 808,
"height": 37.5,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"groupIds": [],
"frameId": null,
"roundness": null,
"seed": 128908319,
"version": 1,
"versionNonce": 1890275919,
"isDeleted": false,
"boundElements": null,
"updated": 1,
"link": null,
"locked": false,
"text": "4. Repetir el mismo chequeo una vez más al llegar a la avenida 100 (sin avanzar: ya no\nhay a dónde ir en esta calle).",
"fontSize": 15,
"fontFamily": 2,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"baseline": 12,
"containerId": null,
"originalText": "4. Repetir el mismo chequeo una vez más al llegar a la avenida 100 (sin avanzar: ya no\nhay a dónde ir en esta calle).",
"lineHeight": 1.25
},
{
"id": "tex_cc3fb2ac7073",
"type": "text",
"x": 6424,
"y": 838.25,
"width": 808,
"height": 18.75,
"angle": 0,
"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
"backgroundColor": "transparent",
"fillStyle": "solid",
"strokeWidth": 1,
"strokeStyle": "solid",
